flowchart TD
  A["Frase afirmativa"] --> B{"¿Tiene am, is, are, was o were?"}
  B -->|"sí"| C["not detrás de to be: He is not here"]
  B -->|"no"| D{"¿Tiene un auxiliar: will, would, may, might, have + participio?"}
  D -->|"sí"| E["not detrás del auxiliar: I will not go · She has not come"]
  D -->|"no"| F{"¿En qué tiempo está el verbo?"}
  F -->|"presente con he, she, it"| G["does not + verbo base: She does not take"]
  F -->|"presente con I, you, we, they"| H["do not + verbo base: They do not come"]
  F -->|"pasado"| I["did not + verbo base: I did not see"]
